{"headword":"נָסַךְ","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. pour out (</strong>NH <em>id.</em>, <em>pour, cast</em> (metals, Pi. <em>make libation;</em> Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">נסך</span> <em>cast</em> gold or iron Lzb<sup>323f.</sup>; 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">נְסַךְ</span> <em>make libation;</em> Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܢܣܰܟ</span> <em>pour out;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">نَسَكَ</span>, orig. <em>be-pour, water</em> Nö<sup>ZMG xli (1887), 719</sup> (rare), usually <em>worship</em> Lane<sup>3032</sup> (cf. RS<sup>Sem. i. 213; 2d ed. 229</sup>), i.e. <em>pour out</em> blood of victim, <em>pour out</em> wine We<sup>Heid. 2, 114, 118, 142</sup><strong>);—</strong>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָסַךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.10\">Is 29:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.19\">40:19</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נָסָ֑ךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.10\">44:10</a>; Impf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִסְּכוּ</span>. <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:4\" href=\"/Hosea.9.4\">Ho 9:4</a>; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּסְּכוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:9\" href=\"/Exodus.30.9\">Ex 30:9</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לִנְסֹךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.1\">Is 30:1</a>; v. ii. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, נָסַךְ²\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_נָסַךְ²\">נסך</a> for <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.7\">Is 25:7</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>pour out</em> (the spirit of deep sleep) c. <span dir=\"rtl\">על</span> pers. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.10\">Is 29:10</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>pour out libations</em>, c. acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶסֶךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:9\" href=\"/Exodus.30.9\">Ex 30:9</a> (P); <span dir=\"rtl\">מַסֵּכָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.1\">Is 30:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יַיִן</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:4\" href=\"/Hosea.9.4\">Ho